 "_notes": ["Portrait: loco_idle_0.", "Aeval fx names orbCharge, orb, orbBig, burst, crescent, arrow, splash, geyser are Aeval moves; Trekmore's equivalents are shadowSword (projectile), shadowBurst (burst), swordRise (world anchored, like geyser). hitspark and ko keep their names because the renderer probes them per character.", "Echo tint has no crop: it is a render bake (plan C.3).", "downed ships the kneel fallback: art/trekmore/pixler/downed_gate.png and downed_gate.json hold the failed A.5 gate."]
